## Conclusion

This project provided practical experience in data preprocessing, exploratory data analysis, and machine learning classification.

Three different algorithms were implemented and compared. The Decision Tree achieved the best accuracy of 85.8%. However, the recall score shows that predicting customers who are likely to leave remains a challenge.

Overall, the project demonstrates how machine learning can help banks understand customer behaviour, identify potential churn, and improve customer retention strategies.

